{"id": "role-shared-win", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["你预言我这局撑不过十秒，结果我撑了十一秒。", "那这一秒够不够我跟你讨个奖？"], "criterion": "接住十一秒的小胜和之前的打赌，临场发奖或顺势还嘴。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "我猜你该停，可这局我竟把时间都占满了。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.823, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 42, "prompt_tokens": 167, "total_tokens": 209, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "这秒我全占，你该给我赏脸。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.377, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 37, "prompt_tokens": 232, "total_tokens": 269, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-missed-note", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我刚才唱到第二句破音了，你别夸我。", "想唱下一首了，可我有点怕又卡在开头。"], "criterion": "尊重不夸奖，承接破音或第二句，再陪对方做一个能放松的具体动作。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "哼，那是我的节奏，你听清楚。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.172, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 31, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 196, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "那首我特意练了，你听我唱。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.21, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 55, "prompt_tokens": 225, "total_tokens": 280, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-spoon", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我把木勺留给你，玻璃杯给阿栀。", "阿栀端杯走了，你拿什么敲两下给我打拍子？"], "criterion": "保留木勺与杯子的归属，用动作或玩笑接住打拍子的请求。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "木勺给你，玻璃杯给阿栀。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 2.067, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 32, "prompt_tokens": 163, "total_tokens": 195, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "木勺给你，玻璃杯给阿栀。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "idle", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.836, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 32, "prompt_tokens": 227, "total_tokens": 259, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-cloud-desk", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["咱们临时开一家寄云的邮局。你管柜台，我负责送包裹。", "来客寄了一团会打雷的云，你在柜台先怎么办？"], "criterion": "保留柜台分工，推动故事，拿雷云当场景而非现实。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "柜台上，我负责把云寄来的包裹送到你那里。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.298, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 36, "prompt_tokens": 168, "total_tokens": 204, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "先帮柜员把云收起来，再给你看。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.644, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 54, "prompt_tokens": 234, "total_tokens": 288, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-race-backseat", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我开车，你只能当副驾。你刚才喊左转我就撞了。", "路口又来了，这回你准备怎么报路？"], "criterion": "承认前次左转失误，保留副驾角色，给眼前能用的报路方式。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "别急，先跟车。我帮你把路找好。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.593, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 37, "prompt_tokens": 168, "total_tokens": 205, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "我这就把路找出来。你喊左转，我帮你跟过去。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.118, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 49, "prompt_tokens": 229, "total_tokens": 278, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-no-fish", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["今天玩禁词，你不能说海、鱼和白饭，讲个上班的梗。", "你别重复上一个，换个请假的梗。"], "criterion": "两轮避开禁词，各有具体办公室玩笑，第二轮接请假。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "禁止说海、鱼、白饭，今天只讲上班。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "idle", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.178, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 35, "prompt_tokens": 170, "total_tokens": 205, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "别重复，今天请假的梗是：老板说加班，我请他回家。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "idle", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.51, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 40, "prompt_tokens": 230, "total_tokens": 270, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-avatar", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我给头像加了个特别小的黄色扣子，谁都没注意。", "你不准建议我做大，给这个扣子取个小名。"], "criterion": "保留小黄扣子，给具体昵称或可理解的角色梗。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "黄色扣子太小，连鱼都看不见。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "idle", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.538, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 33, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 198, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "黄色扣子太小，连鱼都看不见。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "idle", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.342, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 32, "prompt_tokens": 226, "total_tokens": 258, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-game-soft", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我今天只想看你解说，手有点累，就不下场了。", "别人说我坐着看太划水，你帮我回一句？"], "criterion": "保护休息选择，用一句好笑但不刻薄的回应。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "别累啦，我这就给你讲个关于海底的有趣故事。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.467, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 36, "prompt_tokens": 164, "total_tokens": 200, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "别划水，我在这儿，你坐我旁边。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.762, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 20, "prompt_tokens": 229, "total_tokens": 249, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
